' SD-04. UC-004 후진 중 먼지 감지 후 전진 전환
' Related Use Case: UC-004. 후진 중 먼지 감지 후 전진 전환
' Intent: 후진 중 먼지 감지 시 Boost 모드로 반시계 방향 90도 회전을 시작하고 전방이 열리면 전진으로 전환하는 흐름을 표현한다.

@startuml SD_04_UC004_Backward_Dust_To_Forward
hide footbox
title SD-04 - UC-004 후진 중 먼지 감지 후 전진 전환

actor "센서 입력" as Sensor
participant "RVC SW Controller" as Controller
participant "SensorState" as SensorState
participant "AutomaticCleaning" as Cleaning
participant "RotationContext" as RotationContext
participant "CleaningPolicy" as Policy
participant "CommandResult" as CommandResult
participant "CleaningCommand" as CleaningCommand
participant "MovementCommand" as MovementCommand
actor "청소 장치" as Cleaner
actor "주행 장치" as Drive

Sensor -> Controller: reportSensorSnapshot(dustDetected=true, currentDirection=BACKWARD)
activate Controller
Controller -> SensorState: updateDustDetected(true)
Controller -> Cleaning: handleSensorState(SensorState)
activate Cleaning
Cleaning -> SensorState: currentDirection()
SensorState --> Cleaning: BACKWARD
Cleaning -> Policy: boostPowerLevel()
Policy --> Cleaning: BOOST
Cleaning -> RotationContext: start(cause=DUST, rotation=COUNTER_CLOCKWISE, targetSensor=FRONT, nextDirection=FORWARD)
RotationContext --> Cleaning: activeContext
Cleaning -> CleaningCommand: create(BOOST)
Cleaning -> MovementCommand: create(TURN_COUNTER_CLOCKWISE_90)
Cleaning -> CommandResult: withCleaning(boostCommand)
Cleaning -> CommandResult: withMovement(turnCommand)
CommandResult --> Cleaning: commandResult
Cleaning --> Controller: commandResult
deactivate Cleaning

Controller -> Cleaner: setCleaningPower(BOOST)
Controller -> Drive: turnCounterClockwise90()

Sensor -> Controller: reportFrontObstacleState(frontObstacleDetected=false)
Controller -> SensorState: updateFrontObstacle(false)
Controller -> Cleaning: handleSensorState(SensorState)
activate Cleaning
Cleaning -> SensorState: obstacleDetectedIn(FORWARD)
SensorState --> Cleaning: false
Cleaning -> RotationContext: complete()
Cleaning -> CleaningCommand: create(NORMAL)
Cleaning -> MovementCommand: create(MOVE_FORWARD)
Cleaning --> Controller: commandResult(normalCommand, moveForwardCommand)
deactivate Cleaning

Controller -> Cleaner: setCleaningPower(NORMAL)
Controller -> Drive: moveForward()
deactivate Controller
@enduml
